sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Metrics stream
    participant FE as Feature builder
    participant Det as Detector
    participant Sc as Scorer
    participant Ct as Suppression controller
    participant P as Pager
    M->>FE: raw series
    FE->>FE: seasonality and trend features
    FE->>Det: feature vector
    Det->>Sc: anomaly score
    alt score above threshold
        Sc->>Ct: candidate anomaly
        Ct->>Ct: is a deploy or a known event in flight?
        alt correlated with a known change
            Ct-->>Sc: suppress, annotate instead
        else unexplained
            Ct->>P: page with the contributing series
        end
    else normal
        Sc-->>M: feed back as a training sample
    end
